  "content": "<h1>暗光闪耀</h1><p><strong>描述</strong></p><p>将原版附魔闪光改为深蓝色星云般的视觉效果&nbsp;<em><br></em></p><p><em>本模组仅客户端生效</em></p><p>由制作了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 的同样作者开发（想要完整的RPG体验，可获取 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 整合包</a>，享受任务与RPG玩法）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>特性</h2><h5>（以下特性将进一步增强您的原版游戏体验）</h5><h5>将标准原版附魔物品和盔甲的闪光替换为炫酷的深蓝色星云效果，尤其在黑暗中表现绝佳！在辅助功能设置中将闪光强度调至100%可获得最佳效果。</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/812/989/2024-02-23_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/977557893110964374/1135933208790323310/javaw_Tr5W8rud3d.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"801\" height=\"&quot;458\"></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/812/990/2024-02-23_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用服务器与好友联机！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或下方横幅，使用代码<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>立享75折优惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></p>",
